### GET – Alla produkter
GET http://localhost:5072/api/products

### GET – Produkt med ID
GET http://localhost:5072/api/products/6


### GET – Produkt med slug
GET http://localhost:5072/api/products?slug=white-t-shirt

### POST – Skapa en ny produkt
POST http://localhost:5072/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Test",
  "price": 100,
  "image": "test.jpg"
}

### DELETE – Ta bort en produkt
DELETE http://localhost:5072/api/products/6

### GET – Alla kategorier
GET http://localhost:5072/api/categories

### GET – Kategori med ID
GET http://localhost:5072/api/categories/2

### GET – Kategori med slug
GET http://localhost:5072/api/categories?slug=t-shirts

### POST – Skapa en ny kategori
POST http://localhost:5072/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Category",
  "image": "test.jpg"
}

### DELETE – Ta bort en kategori
DELETE http://localhost:5072/api/categories/3

### GET – Produkt med slug som inte finns
GET http://localhost:5072/api/products?slug=finns-inte-12345

### GET – Kategori med slug som inte finns
GET http://localhost:5072/api/categories?slug=finns-inte-12345